  "rationale": "Pooled dCas12a CRISPRi fitness screen in A549 cells with four-crRNA pre-crRNA arrays (171 arrays for 145 core-essential genes, 34-48 cell-surface control arrays, 50 non-targeting and 25 intergenic arrays, plus synthetic-lethal combination arrays), run with four repressors (dHyperLbCas12a-KRAB or -4xSID, dEnAsCas12a-KRAB or -4xSID) in three independent transductions sampled at days 5, 7, 14 and 21. The paper models array abundance over time per repressor (DESeq2 LRT on days, MAGeCK MLE) and compares repressors by depletion of essential-gene arrays. BARCS compares day 21 with day 5 per repressor, paired by transduction (~ replicate + day), with library totals; 3 vs 3, 2 residual df. Counts are column 3 of the per-sample idxstats files (identical to the paper's Supplementary Data 1 raw counts); prepare.R labels genes as the paper's MAGeCK gene names (single-target combination arrays X-k-NT / NT-X-k pooled under X, double-target arrays under the sorted pair). Controls: NT and NEG (intergenic) arrays. Primary analysis: dHyperLbCas12a-KRAB.",
